          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %strong cartesian multicategory
            is a
            = succeed "-like" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multicategory"} multicategory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/products"} products
            in the same way that ordinary multicategories are related to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+categories"} monoidal categories
          %h2#definition Definition
          %h3#explicit Explicit
          %p
            A
            %strong cartesian multicategory
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+multicategory"} symmetric multicategory
            equipped with:
